.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*token*
*secret*
*credential*
*cookie*
cookies*
hosts.yml
.netrc
.npmrc
.ssh/
.gnupg/
*storage_state*
*storageState*
user-data*/
*Chrome*/
*chromium*/
*firefox*/
